-- 253: covering indexes for business foreign keys (stress test 2026-10-07).
--
-- The Supabase performance advisor flagged 952 foreign keys with no index
-- whose leading columns match the key. Without one, joins on these keys and
-- every DELETE/UPDATE of a referenced row scan the child table, which gets
-- slower as data grows.
--
-- Covered here: every unindexed FK except those that only point at
-- core.users (created_by / approved_by style audit columns that are never
-- filtered on - indexing those 392 would add write cost for no read benefit).
-- Generated from the live catalogue; names are ix_<table>_<cols>_<hash>.
-- IF NOT EXISTS makes this safe to re-run. Site-day tables from migration
-- 252 are deliberately left out so this file doesn't depend on it.

